{"seq":3,"slug":"large-deviations-in-practice","title":"应用与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice/large-deviations-in-practice","wordCount":2044,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用与边界\">应用与边界</h1><p>前两篇展示了大偏差在物理、工程、金融的威力。但一门理论的成熟标志，不只是知道它能做什么，更是清楚它做不到什么、以及在它给不出解析解时怎么办。这一篇收束全书，聚焦两件事：一是当率函数无法手算时，有哪些计算方法（从经典的分裂算法到 2025 年的机器学习途径）；二是大偏差与它的邻居——中心极限定理、极值理论——各自的适用边界，以及越界使用会带来什么灾难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇收束全书，核心是两组概念。其一是<strong>数值方法谱系</strong>：当真率函数无闭式解时，按问题结构选工具——重要性采样（最优倾斜，单路径最优）、分裂/克隆（稀有样本繁殖，多路径稳健）、神经网络/强化学习（参数化倾斜或最优路径，高维非马氏前沿）、逐点谱方法（倾斜算子 Perron 特征值，马氏链低维）。其二是<strong>大偏差的三条边界</strong>：与中心极限按尺度分（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 宏观 vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\sqrt n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 日常）、与极值按问题分（均值偏离 vs 最大值）、按尾型分（轻尾指数律 vs 重尾 single big jump）。此外还须记住<strong>首阶之外的前因子</strong>：指数律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-nI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 冲掉所有多项式前因子，工程精度需补 Bahadur-Rao 精化。多数实务错误都源于跳过&quot;先确认尾型&quot;这一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当率函数算不出来-数值方法谱系\">当率函数算不出来：数值方法谱系</h2><p>Cramér、Gärtner-Ellis 给出的率函数在简单模型里能手算，但真实系统（相互作用粒子、非马氏动力学、高维路径）的 SCGF 或作用泛函往往没有闭式解。此时需要数值方法，它们大致分三类。</p>\n<p><strong>直接蒙特卡洛 + 重要性采样</strong>：如上一篇所述，用大偏差指出的最优倾斜换测度（见 <a href=\"queueing-finance\">排队与金融</a>）。优点是无偏、理论最优；缺点是倾斜分布难选，多路径时方差易爆。</p>\n<p><strong>分裂 / 克隆算法 (splitting / cloning)</strong>：不换测度，而是让走向稀有区的样本&quot;繁殖&quot;、走向典型区的样本&quot;消亡&quot;，从而把计算资源集中到重要区域。这类方法（Rare Event Splitting、Adaptive Multilevel Splitting、克隆算法）对多路径和路径依赖问题比重要性采样稳健，是模拟非平衡稳态大偏差、化学反应罕见跃迁的主力。</p>\n<p><strong>机器学习辅助</strong>：2023 年以来兴起的方向。用神经网络参数化最优倾斜控制或作用泛函的极小路径，把求 SCGF 变成一个优化/强化学习问题。代表性工作包括用神经网络计算随机动力系统大偏差前因子（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2306.11418\">arXiv 2306.11418</a>）、以及用神经强化学习处理带记忆的非平衡系统大偏差（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2501.12333v2\">arXiv 2501.12333</a>）。这些方法把高维、非马氏这类传统方法束手无策的问题重新纳入可计算范围，是当前最活跃的前沿。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n<th>主要弱点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重要性采样</td>\n<td>最优指数倾斜换测度</td>\n<td>单路径、轻尾</td>\n<td>多路径方差爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分裂/克隆</td>\n<td>稀有样本繁殖、典型样本消亡</td>\n<td>多路径、路径依赖</td>\n<td>参数调节敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>神经网络/强化学习</td>\n<td>参数化倾斜或最优路径</td>\n<td>高维、非马氏</td>\n<td>训练成本、无理论保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐点谱方法</td>\n<td>倾斜算子的 Perron 特征值</td>\n<td>马氏链、低维</td>\n<td>维数灾难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大偏差的三条边界\">大偏差的三条边界</h2><p>一个成熟的实践者，遇到尾部问题的第一反应应该是判断&quot;这归谁管&quot;。大偏差有三条清晰的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>与中心极限定理的边界（尺度）</strong>：中心极限管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\sqrt n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的日常涨落，大偏差管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的宏观偏差，中间由中等偏差衔接（见 <a href=\"../foundations/rare-events\">稀有事件的指数尺度</a>）。用 CLT 的高斯尾去估宏观偏差会系统性失真——正态是唯一率函数等于高斯尾的分布，其余都不是。</p>\n<p><strong>与极值理论的边界（问什么）</strong>：大偏差问&quot;平均值大幅偏离&quot;，极值理论问&quot;最大值的分布&quot;（见 <a href=\"../../extreme-value-theory/foundations/why-extreme-values\">为何研究极值</a>）。二者都关心尾部却是不同的问题：一笔组合的总损失偏大（大偏差，多项协同）与单日最大跌幅（极值，单项主宰）需要不同工具。</p>\n<p><strong>轻尾 vs 重尾的边界（尾型）</strong>：这是最致命的一条。大偏差的指数律要求矩母函数局部有限（轻尾）。若分布重尾（幂律），矩母函数处处发散，Cramér 与 Gärtner-Ellis 双双失效，尾部由<strong>单次巨大事件</strong>主宰而非多次小事件协同——衰减是多项式而非指数，且&quot;最可能路径&quot;退化为&quot;一步跳到位&quot;（single big jump 原理）。此时须改用极值/重尾专门理论（见 <a href=\"../../extreme-value-theory/models/pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托分布</a>）。</p>\n<p>三条边界的决策流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一个尾部/稀有事件问题] --&gt; B{问的是均值偏离&lt;br/&gt;还是最大值?}&#10;  B --&gt;|最大值分布| C[极值理论]&#10;  B --&gt;|均值大幅偏离| D{偏差尺度?}&#10;  D --&gt;|O 1/√n 日常涨落| E[中心极限定理]&#10;  D --&gt;|O 1 宏观偏差| F{尾型 矩母函数有限?}&#10;  F --&gt;|轻尾 有限| G[大偏差 指数律 e^-nI]&#10;  F --&gt;|重尾 幂律| H[重尾/极值理论&lt;br/&gt;single big jump 非指数]&#10;  G --&gt; I[能手算? → Cramér/GE&lt;br/&gt;否则 → 数值/ML]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一个尾部/稀有事件问题] --&gt; B{问的是均值偏离&lt;br/&gt;还是最大值?}\n  B --&gt;|最大值分布| C[极值理论]\n  B --&gt;|均值大幅偏离| D{偏差尺度?}\n  D --&gt;|O 1/√n 日常涨落| E[中心极限定理]\n  D --&gt;|O 1 宏观偏差| F{尾型 矩母函数有限?}\n  F --&gt;|轻尾 有限| G[大偏差 指数律 e^-nI]\n  F --&gt;|重尾 幂律| H[重尾/极值理论&lt;br/&gt;single big jump 非指数]\n  G --&gt; I[能手算? → Cramér/GE&lt;br/&gt;否则 → 数值/ML]</pre><h2 id=\"一张选型速查表\">一张选型速查表</h2><p>把上面的边界判断浓缩成一张实操速查表，方便在遇到具体问题时快速对号入座。它按&quot;你观测到的现象&quot;倒推该用哪套工具与哪种算法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的问题</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>推荐算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均值偏离一个宏观量、尾轻</td>\n<td>矩母函数局部有限</td>\n<td>大偏差（Cramér/GE）</td>\n<td>指数倾斜重要性采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相依序列的和偏离</td>\n<td>SCGF 极限存在且光滑</td>\n<td>Gärtner-Ellis</td>\n<td>倾斜谱方法 / 分裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整个经验分布偏离</td>\n<td>有限或可数字母表</td>\n<td>Sanov（相对熵）</td>\n<td>类型枚举 / 变分求解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高维路径的稀有跃迁</td>\n<td>作用泛函无闭式</td>\n<td>Freidlin-Wentzell</td>\n<td>神经网络 / 强化学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次极端值主导</td>\n<td>重尾、矩母函数发散</td>\n<td>极值 / 重尾理论</td>\n<td>POT / single big jump</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日常涨落幅度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\sqrt n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 尺度</td>\n<td>中心极限定理</td>\n<td>解析高斯近似</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值在于把&quot;用哪个定理&quot;从凭经验变成看判据：先确认尾型（轻/重）与观测对象（均值/分布/路径/最大值），再顺着行读出工具与算法。多数实务错误都源于跳过第一步——尤其是没确认尾型就默认指数律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前因子-大偏差之外还剩什么\">前因子：大偏差之外还剩什么</h2><p>即便落在大偏差适用范围内，指数律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-nI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也只是首阶。它冲掉了所有多项式前因子（见 <a href=\"../foundations/rare-events\">稀有事件的指数尺度</a>），而工程上要精确概率时前因子不可忽略——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{-1/2}e^{-nI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17e^{-nI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在对数尺度等价，但数值差几十倍。<strong>Bahadur-Rao 精化</strong>给出了独立同分布尾概率的完整渐近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\bar S_n\\ge a)\\sim\\frac{C}{\\sqrt n}e^{-nI(a)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.426em;vertical-align:-0.538em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.6259em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8059em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.538em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，补上了前因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{-1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 修正。实践中若只需知道&quot;稀有到哪个数量级&quot;，裸的率函数够用；若需可信的绝对概率（如安全认证要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 级别的精度），必须补前因子——这也是近年 ML 方法着力计算前因子的原因（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2306.11418\">arXiv 2306.11418</a>）。忘记这一点，是把大偏差从&quot;估量级的利器&quot;误用成&quot;报精确值的工具&quot;的常见错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>率函数算不出时有三类数值方法：重要性采样（最优倾斜、单路径最优）、分裂/克隆（多路径稳健）、神经网络/强化学习（高维非马氏前沿，2023 年后兴起）。</li>\n<li>大偏差有三条边界：与中心极限按尺度分（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1/\\sqrt n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、与极值按问题分（均值偏离 vs 最大值）、按尾型分（轻尾指数律 vs 重尾 single big jump）。</li>\n<li>重尾是最致命的越界：矩母函数发散使 Cramér/Gärtner-Ellis 失效，须改用极值/重尾理论，否则严重误判风险。</li>\n<li>指数律只是首阶，工程精度需补 Bahadur-Rao 前因子；裸率函数只报量级，不报绝对概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>计算所用的最优倾斜：<a href=\"queueing-finance\">排队与金融</a></li>\n<li>前因子被冲掉的原因：<a href=\"../foundations/rare-events\">稀有事件的指数尺度</a></li>\n<li>最可能路径的变分来源：<a href=\"../principles/contraction-principle\">收缩原理</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照——重尾尾部的建模：<a href=\"../../extreme-value-theory/models/pot-gpd\">POT 与广义帕累托分布</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照——蒙特卡洛与采样收敛诊断：<a href=\"../../markov-chain-monte-carlo/practice/convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用与边界","id":"应用与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"当率函数算不出来：数值方法谱系","id":"当率函数算不出来-数值方法谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"大偏差的三条边界","id":"大偏差的三条边界"},{"level":2,"text":"一张选型速查表","id":"一张选型速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"前因子：大偏差之外还剩什么","id":"前因子-大偏差之外还剩什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"排队与金融","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/practice/queueing-finance"},"next":null}